        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marie Fredriksson, Bada, Per Gessle\n- Roles: singer-songwriter, pianist, musical actress\n- Organizations: Roxette\n- Topics: pop music, South Korean music, Swedish music\n\nFacts:\n- Marie Fredriksson was born on 30 May 1958.\n- Marie Fredriksson was a Swedish pop singer-songwriter and pianist.\n- In 1986, Marie Fredriksson and Per Gessle created the pop rock duo Roxette.\n- Marie Fredriksson was best known as one half of Roxette.\n- Choi Sung-hee was born on February 28, 1980.\n- Choi Sung-hee was better known as Bada or Sea.\n- Bada was a South Korean singer and musical actress.",
